   "new": "{\"1\": \"OECD-YEM-019\", \"2\": \"Informal sector\", \"3\": \"Financial transactions outside the formal financial sector\", \"4\": 70, \"5\": \"percent (almost)\", \"6\": \"currently (undated)\", \"7\": \"OECD (2026) states that almost 70% of financial transactions in Yemen are currently performed outside the formal financial sector (printed p.35).\", \"8\": \"تذكر منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية (2026) أن قرابة 70% من المعاملات المالية في اليمن تجري حاليًا خارج القطاع المالي الرسمي (ص. 35).\", \"9\": \"SRC-OECD-YEM-RESILIENCE-001\", \"10\": \"https://www.oecd.org/content/dam/oecd/en/publications/reports/2026/02/promoting-economic-resilience-in-yemen_b66657c1/81ed2898-en.pdf\", \"11\": \"ATTRIBUTED__NOT_PROJECTED\", \"12\": \"ATTRIBUTED__NOT_PROJECTED (11 October 2026): no source, date or method is given; not to be confused with 'approximately 70% of surveyed firms' (printed p.9) (audit/close_out/v5_reads/V2_ylg_oecd.md). Not projected.\"}"
  },
