   "new": "{\"1\": \"OECD-YEM-021\", \"2\": \"Banks\", \"3\": \"Banks operating in Yemen\", \"4\": 22, \"5\": \"banks\", \"6\": \"currently (undated)\", \"7\": \"OECD (2026) states that 22 banks are currently operating in Yemen: 3 state-owned, 4 domestic commercial, 4 foreign-owned commercial, 5 Islamic and 6 microfinance banks (printed p.29).\", \"8\": \"تذكر منظمة التعاون الاقتصادي والتنمية (2026) أن 22 بنكًا تعمل حاليًا في اليمن: 3 بنوك حكومية و4 بنوك تجارية محلية و4 بنوك تجارية مملوكة لأجانب و5 بنوك إسلامية و6 بنوك للتمويل الأصغر (ص. 29).\", \"9\": \"SRC-OECD-YEM-RESILIENCE-001\", \"10\": \"https://www.oecd.org/content/dam/oecd/en/publications/reports/2026/02/promoting-economic-resilience-in-yemen_b66657c1/81ed2898-en.pdf\", \"11\": \"ATTRIBUTED__NOT_PROJECTED\", \"12\": \"ATTRIBUTED__NOT_PROJECTED (11 October 2026): no as-of date and no source; not reconciled with the CBY-Aden rosters (audit/close_out/v5_reads/V2_ylg_oecd.md). Not projected.\"}"
